{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">NULLWAKE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NullWake is a psychological horror game about isolation, uncertainty, and the slow collapse of reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in an abandoned hospital.<br>The building feels familiar, almost safe \u2014 until small details begin to feel wrong.<br>Lights flicker. Corridors stretch longer than they should.<br>The world does not break all at once. It erodes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073560/extras/df2ae9b1b68a9a8ec60fb1b870743162.avif?t=1769167723\" width=1560 height=790 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you move forward, the environment changes around you.<br>A deserted town. Empty streets. Mannequins standing where no one should be.<br>Locations blend together, as if different worlds are overlapping.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NullWake does not explain everything.<br>It lets you notice what should not exist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fear here is not constant \u2014 it waits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073560/extras/52f960ba2c8ebb7c82ae60ccf041c42c.avif?t=1769167723\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073560/extras_big/52f960ba2c8ebb7c82ae60ccf041c42c.webp?t=1769167723 width=1560 height=893 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ATMOSPHERE OVER ACTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The horror in NullWake is built on tension, silence, and expectation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are moments where nothing happens.<br>Those moments are intentional.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies do not follow predictable rules.<br>Sometimes the safest option is to stop moving.<br>Sometimes stopping is the worst choice you can make.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A FRAGMENTED STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story is told through environments, visual clues, and subtle changes in the world.<br>Not everything you see can be trusted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reality shifts slowly, and the game never tells you exactly when it happens.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological horror focused on atmosphere and tension<br>Multiple interconnected locations<br>Unpredictable enemy behavior<br>Environmental storytelling<br>A slow, oppressive pacing inspired by classic horror experiences</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NullWake is not loud.<br>It does not rush you.<br>It waits for you to realize that something is wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And by then, it is already too late.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4073560?t=1769167723","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073560/a905b2485797f3bffcea8778a507b66cb167e9ed/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769167723","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073560/8d89f6fdb7907a1a9f73ca77c4d98ec213644ef2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769167723","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073560/8d89f6fdb7907a1a9f73ca77c4d98ec213644ef2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769167723","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">NULLWAKE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NullWake is a psychological horror game about isolation, uncertainty, and the slow collapse of reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in an abandoned hospital.<br>The building feels familiar, almost safe \u2014 until small details begin to feel wrong.<br>Lights flicker. Corridors stretch longer than they should.<br>The world does not break all at once. It erodes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073560/extras/df2ae9b1b68a9a8ec60fb1b870743162.avif?t=1769167723\" width=1560 height=790 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you move forward, the environment changes around you.<br>A deserted town. Empty streets. Mannequins standing where no one should be.<br>Locations blend together, as if different worlds are overlapping.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NullWake does not explain everything.<br>It lets you notice what should not exist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fear here is not constant \u2014 it waits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073560/extras/52f960ba2c8ebb7c82ae60ccf041c42c.avif?t=1769167723\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073560/extras_big/52f960ba2c8ebb7c82ae60ccf041c42c.webp?t=1769167723 width=1560 height=893 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ATMOSPHERE OVER ACTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The horror in NullWake is built on tension, silence, and expectation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are moments where nothing happens.<br>Those moments are intentional.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies do not follow predictable rules.<br>Sometimes the safest option is to stop moving.<br>Sometimes stopping is the worst choice you can make.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A FRAGMENTED STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story is told through environments, visual clues, and subtle changes in the world.<br>Not everything you see can be trusted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reality shifts slowly, and the game never tells you exactly when it happens.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological horror focused on atmosphere and tension<br>Multiple interconnected locations<br>Unpredictable enemy behavior<br>Environmental storytelling<br>A slow, oppressive pacing inspired by classic horror experiences</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NullWake is not loud.<br>It does not rush you.<br>It waits for you to realize that something is wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And by then, it is already too late.</p>","developers":["44days company"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073560/0d15968d64bd8a9c5e25cc57e1a7b677a573b53a/header.jpg?t=1769167723","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4073560/21710017/fa64ddeff56502323f815b9859f5384ada16165d/1762811707/dash_av1.mpd?t=1766637174","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4073560/21710017/fa64ddeff56502323f815b9859f5384ada16165d/1762811707/dash_h264.mpd?t=1766637174","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4073560/21710017/fa64ddeff56502323f815b9859f5384ada16165d/1762811707/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1766637174","id":257229326,"name":"Nullwake trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257229326/d1fee2bbd00d13fc49bc04d0357d84925d96c2bf/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1766637174"}],"name":"Nullwake","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_